title: Authorizations › Case page › Clinical picture
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=picture
intro: The second tab: what Reader and Placement built from the chart, the six ASAM dimensions, the trend chart, and the 'Still open' list whose 'Settle it' buttons jump back to a recommendation.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the chart content is generated text for every request except R-1042, which is hand-written.
---
start s1 "Click 'Clinical picture'"
screen pt "Clinical picture\nLeft: summary, ASAM dimensions, trend. Right: what stands out, engagement, still open"

group gL "Left column"
  screen sm "Card 'Clinical picture'\n'Built by Reader and Placement from the chart. Every line links back to a file.'\nRows: Diagnosis, Status, Trajectory, Readiness"
  click ch "Click the source chip beside a row"
  decision dRd "Is anything still open?"
  process r1 "Readiness reads 'The draft is ready for signature.'"
  process r2 "Readiness reads 'The request is ready for signature once the open items below are settled.'"
  screen as "Card 'ASAM dimensions'\nSix cards: number, name, one sentence and a word\nNone, Low, Moderate, High or Severe"
  screen tr "Card 'Symptom and function trend'\nLine chart by date with a legend\nA missing score is left as a gap"
  process ks "Two tiles under the chart\ne.g. 'Withdrawal now 4 / 67, peak 14' and 'Depression now 17 / 27'"
endgroup

group gR "Right column"
  screen so "Card 'What stands out'\nFour short lines"
  screen en "Card 'Engagement and behavior'\nPercent and bar, with a word\nStrong 85+, Moderate 70–84, Low below 70\nThen three ticked checks"
  screen op "Card 'Still open'\nCount pill and one line per open item\nConflict, Missing or Risk"
  decision dOp "Any open items?"
  process no "'Nothing is open. Every conflict, document and risk is settled.'"
  click se "Click 'Settle it' on a line"
endgroup

process dl "Recommended actions opens with that card outlined"
process ap "An item leaves 'Still open' when its action is applied\nDismissing the action does not clear it"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Source chip"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › The tab"

s1 --> pt
pt --> sm --> dRd
dRd -->|Yes| r2
dRd -->|No| r1
sm --> ch --> g1
pt --> as
pt --> tr --> ks
pt --> so
pt --> en
pt --> op --> dOp
dOp -->|Yes| se --> dl --> g2
dOp -->|No| no
se -.-> ap
